  "text": "I even believe, I kid you not, that one day Ethereum is going to flip Bitcoin. I hate ETH, but I gotta go where the money is. I did the same thing with Litecoin. I was like, I can't believe I'm getting back into Litecoin. Right? Because, you know, it's a made in America token, ETFs, and now it has an optional privacy feature so I'm like, okay. Ethereum starts giving me the vibe that Ethereum is going to be like a totally dominant. And I hate Ethereum. I hate it. I hate it. But then it's okay, I'll buy into it. Because I know it's going to pump like crazy. I think that $20,000 ETH is really conservative, in my opinion. Ten years from now.",
